# Keep shell scripts as LF and executable.
#
# This repository was bitten by a lost POSIX executable bit (the Gradle
# wrapper failed with exit 126 in CI), and a CRLF line ending in a shell
# script fails on Linux with "bad interpreter: /bin/bash^M". Both are
# invisible on a Windows checkout, so they are pinned here rather than
# left to each developer's core.autocrlf setting.

* text=auto

*.sh text eol=lf
gradlew text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.kt text eol=lf
*.kts text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.csv text eol=lf
*.tflite binary
*.apk binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.zip binary
